---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Request a pilot, ask a technical question, or start a partnership or investment conversation with HelTru.">

  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-16 pb-24 grid md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] gap-16">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight max-w-lg">Tell us what you're trying to protect.</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-ink-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Whether it's a pilot in one facility, a technical architecture review under NDA, or an investment
          conversation, the form on the right reaches us directly.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6">
          <div class="border-t border-mist-300 pt-5">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-500">EMAIL</p>
            <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="mt-1 block text-lg text-evergreen-600 font-semibold hover:underline">{site.email}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-mist-300 pt-5">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-500">LOCATION</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-900">{site.location}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-mist-300 pt-5">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-500">FOR PILOT PARTNERS</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
              Mention the domain (eldercare, workplace safety, lone worker, sports, pediatric, or industrial),
              roughly how many people or devices, and your timeline; that's enough to start a conversation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Send a message</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-500 leading-relaxed">
          This goes straight to our inbox. We reply to the email address you provide, usually within a couple
          of business days.
        </p>

        <div data-fs-success class="hidden mt-4 border border-evergreen-500/40 bg-evergreen-500/10 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-evergreen-600">
          Thanks, that's on its way. We'll reply by email shortly.
        </div>
        <div data-fs-error class="hidden mt-4 border border-fault-500/40 bg-fault-500/10 p-4 font-mono text-xs text-fault-600"></div>

        <form id="contact-form" class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          <!-- Honeypot: real visitors never fill this in, bots often do -->
          <input type="text" name="_gotcha" class="hidden" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />

          <div>
            <label class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-500" for="name">Name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required data-fs-field class="mt-1 w-full border border-mist-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-ink-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-evergreen-500" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-500" for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required data-fs-field class="mt-1 w-full border border-mist-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-ink-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-evergreen-500" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-500" for="organization">Organization</label>
            <input id="organization" name="organization" type="text" data-fs-field class="mt-1 w-full border border-mist-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-ink-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-evergreen-500" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-500" for="message">What are you trying to protect?</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" required data-fs-field class="mt-1 w-full border border-mist-300 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-ink-900 focus:outline-none focus:border-evergreen-500"></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" data-fs-submit-btn class="btn-primary w-full justify-center">Send message</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script define:vars={{ formId: site.formspreeFormId }}>
    window.formspree = window.formspree || function () { (formspree.q = formspree.q || []).push(arguments); };
    formspree('initForm', { formElement: '#contact-form', formId: formId });
  </script>
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/@formspree/ajax@1" defer></script>

</BaseLayout>
